{"seq":2,"slug":"hamming-window","title":"汉明窗","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/hamming-window","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"汉明窗\">汉明窗</h1><p>&quot;汉明窗&quot;（Hamming window）是一种窗函数，至今仍是数字信号处理中最常用的窗之一。它由理查德·汉明设计、由约翰·图基（John Tukey）推广，用于在做有限长信号的频谱分析（FFT）时抑制&quot;频谱泄漏&quot;。它把汉明的应用数学风格体现得淋漓尽致：针对一个具体工程痛点，用一个精心调参的简单公式，换来卓越的实测性能。</p>\n<p>本篇聚焦汉明窗的公式、性能与取舍；窗函数所属的更广数值分析学科背景见 <a href=\"../numerical-methods/numerical-analysis\">数值分析</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>窗函数是一类很小的数学对象，却浓缩了汉明式工程方法论的三个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>截断即乘窗</strong>：对信号取有限长的一段，等价于把无限长信号乘上一个矩形窗。矩形窗的硬边沿正是频谱泄漏的根源，换一个两端平滑的窗就消掉了它。</li>\n<li><strong>泄漏与分辨率不可兼得</strong>：压低旁瓣必然加宽主瓣，从而降低频率分辨率。这是所有窗函数设计绕不开的权衡，没有例外。</li>\n<li><strong>参数由实测性能决定，而非由优雅决定</strong>：汉明窗的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.54</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span></span></span></span></span> 并非理论上最优（最优约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>46</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5435</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25/46 \\approx 0.5435</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/46</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5435</span></span></span></span></span>），而是为抵消最近旁瓣峰值调出来的、便于手算的取值。工具好不好，看它在实测指标上压得多低。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"频谱泄漏-窗函数要解决的问题\">频谱泄漏：窗函数要解决的问题</h2><p>FFT 隐含假设被分析的有限段信号是&quot;周期重复&quot;的。若直接截取一段信号（等价于乘一个矩形窗），截断处的突然断裂会在频谱上产生大量虚假旁瓣——这就是<strong>频谱泄漏</strong>：一个单频正弦的能量&quot;漏&quot;到本不该有的频率上，淹没附近的弱信号。</p>\n<p>窗函数的思路是：用一个两端平滑趋零、中间隆起的包络去乘信号，消除截断处的硬边沿，从而压低旁瓣。代价是主瓣变宽、频率分辨率下降——这是窗函数设计永恒的权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  S[&quot;有限段信号&quot;] --&gt; R[&quot;矩形窗(直接截断)&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; L[&quot;频谱: 主瓣窄, 旁瓣高(-13dB), 泄漏严重&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; H[&quot;乘汉明窗(两端平滑)&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; G[&quot;频谱: 主瓣略宽, 旁瓣低(-43dB), 泄漏小&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n  S[\"有限段信号\"] --&gt; R[\"矩形窗(直接截断)\"]\n  R --&gt; L[\"频谱: 主瓣窄, 旁瓣高(-13dB), 泄漏严重\"]\n  S --&gt; H[\"乘汉明窗(两端平滑)\"]\n  H --&gt; G[\"频谱: 主瓣略宽, 旁瓣低(-43dB), 泄漏小\"]</pre><h2 id=\"汉明窗的公式与设计巧思\">汉明窗的公式与设计巧思</h2><p>汉明窗是&quot;广义汉明窗&quot;族 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(n)=\\alpha-(1-\\alpha)\\cos(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的一个特定取值。其定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.46</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(n) = 0.54 - 0.46 \\cos\\!\\left(\\frac{2\\pi n}{N-1}\\right),\\quad 0 \\le n \\le N-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.54</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta=0.46</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span></span></span></span></span> 不是随手取的整齐数字，而是为<strong>抵消最近的旁瓣峰值</strong>而优化出来的。精确的最优值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>46</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5435</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=25/46\\approx0.5435</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/46</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5435</span></span></span></span></span>；汉明取 0.54 是便于手算的近似。正是这一调参，使第一旁瓣几乎被压平（来源：<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/sasp/Hamming_Window.html\">Hamming Window, CCRMA Stanford</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其它窗的对比-取舍一目了然\">与其它窗的对比：取舍一目了然</h2><p>汉明窗最常被拿来和形状相似的汉宁窗（Hann window，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5-0.5\\cos</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span></span></span></span></span>）对比。关键差别在两端：汉明窗两端不归零（约 0.08），汉宁窗两端严格归零。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>窗类型</th>\n<th>公式系数</th>\n<th>第一旁瓣电平</th>\n<th>主瓣宽度</th>\n<th>旁瓣滚降</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矩形窗</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>约 -13 dB</td>\n<td>最窄</td>\n<td>慢（-6 dB/oct）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汉宁窗（Hann）</td>\n<td>0.5 / 0.5</td>\n<td>约 -31 dB</td>\n<td>较宽</td>\n<td>快（-18 dB/oct）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汉明窗（Hamming）</td>\n<td>0.54 / 0.46</td>\n<td>约 <strong>-43 dB</strong></td>\n<td>与汉宁相近</td>\n<td>慢（-6 dB/oct）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布莱克曼窗（Blackman）</td>\n<td>三项</td>\n<td>约 -58 dB</td>\n<td>最宽</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.numberanalytics.com/blog/comparing-hanning-hamming-blackman-windows\">Comparing Hanning, Hamming &amp; Blackman Windows</a>、<a href=\"https://ccrma.stanford.edu/~jos/Windows/Windows.pdf\">CCRMA MUS421 Windows</a>。</p>\n<p>核心权衡：汉明窗用&quot;两端不归零&quot;换来了<strong>最低的第一旁瓣（约 -43 dB）</strong>——这正是它压制邻近强干扰的强项；但代价是远处旁瓣滚降慢，远端泄漏不如汉宁窗干净。</p>\n<h2 id=\"该用哪个窗-选择准则\">该用哪个窗：选择准则</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>要分辨两个频率接近、强度悬殊的信号</strong> → 用汉明窗：低首旁瓣能让强信号不掩盖近旁弱信号。</li>\n<li><strong>要看宽频带、关心远处杂散</strong> → 用汉宁窗：远端滚降快，整体泄漏地板更低。</li>\n<li><strong>追求极致动态范围（如音频测量）</strong> → 用布莱克曼或更复杂的窗，接受主瓣变宽。</li>\n<li><strong>要精确测幅度而非分辨频率</strong> → 用平顶窗（flat-top）。</li>\n<li><strong>信号本身就是完整周期/瞬态</strong> → 可能矩形窗反而最优。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与边界\">反模式与边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>没有&quot;最好的窗&quot;，只有&quot;最适合任务的窗&quot;</strong>：脱离应用场景问&quot;哪个窗好&quot;是伪命题。</li>\n<li><strong>加窗会衰减幅度</strong>：窗的相干增益小于 1，做幅度测量时必须用窗的等效噪声带宽/相干增益做归一化补偿，否则读数偏低。</li>\n<li><strong>窗不能凭空提高分辨率</strong>：它只重新分配泄漏能量，主瓣变宽通常意味着分辨率略降，不能用窗来&quot;超分辨&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>别和 FIR 滤波器设计里的窗法混淆</strong>：同样叫&quot;窗&quot;，那里是用窗截断理想冲激响应，目标是控制过渡带与阻带波纹，约束不完全相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"应用数学的典范\">应用数学的典范</h2><p>汉明窗是汉明科研哲学的缩影：不追求理论上最优雅的形式，而是针对频谱泄漏这一具体痛点，把一族两参数函数调到实测旁瓣最低，交付一个工程师立刻能用、且几十年不过时的工具。从语音/音频的频谱分析、雷达脉冲压缩，到通信系统的频率估计，汉明窗无处不在。这种&quot;由实际需求驱动、以实测性能定优劣&quot;的取向，与他在纠错码、数值方法上的做法完全一致，其思想根源见 <a href=\"../computing-foundations/mechanizing-thought\">计算与科学的未来</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>汉明窗是 FFT 频谱分析中抑制频谱泄漏的窗函数，形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.54</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.46</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(n)=0.54-0.46\\cos(2\\pi n/(N-1))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.54</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.46</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，两端不归零（约 0.08）。</li>\n<li>系数的选择是为压平最近旁瓣峰值的经验调参，精确最优值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>46</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25/46</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/46</span></span></span></span></span>，取 0.54 是为便于手算。</li>\n<li>其取舍是&quot;最低第一旁瓣（约 -43 dB）&quot;换&quot;远端滚降慢&quot;：分辨邻近强弱悬殊信号时优于汉宁窗，关心远处杂散时不如汉宁窗。</li>\n<li>使用边界：加窗会衰减幅度需按相干增益补偿；窗只重新分配泄漏能量，不能凭空提高分辨率；别与 FIR 设计中的&quot;窗法&quot;混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"汉明窗","id":"汉明窗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"频谱泄漏：窗函数要解决的问题","id":"频谱泄漏-窗函数要解决的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"汉明窗的公式与设计巧思","id":"汉明窗的公式与设计巧思"},{"level":2,"text":"与其它窗的对比：取舍一目了然","id":"与其它窗的对比-取舍一目了然"},{"level":2,"text":"该用哪个窗：选择准则","id":"该用哪个窗-选择准则"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与边界","id":"反模式与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"应用数学的典范","id":"应用数学的典范"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数值分析","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/numerical-methods/numerical-analysis"},"next":{"title":"早期计算的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/core-contributions/computing-foundations/early-computing"}}